---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Fight for Manhood
description: Fight for Manhood is a ten-week biblical formation experience helping men confront shame, fear, passivity, and isolation through truth, brotherhood, grace, and responsibility.
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="announcement">
      <strong>The Fight is growing</strong>
      <span>One proven journey &middot; More communities preparing to enter the fight</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pill-row">
      <span class="pill">{{ site.program.duration }} &middot; Biblical formation</span>
      <span class="pill">Truth &middot; Brotherhood &middot; Grace &middot; Responsibility</span>
    </div>

    <header class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">A formation experience for men</span>
      <h1><span class="hero-line">Stand as a son.</span><span class="hero-line gold">Fight like a man.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">A ten-week biblical journey for men who are done drifting&mdash;built to confront <span class="gold">shame, fear, passivity, isolation, and the double life.</span></p>
      <p class="sublead">High challenge. High support. Honest brotherhood. A clear path toward healing, responsibility, and life as a son of God.</p>
      <div class="button-row hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/program/">Explore the program</a><a class="button" href="#cohorts">Find a cohort</a></div>
    </header>

    <section class="section cohort-section" id="cohorts" aria-labelledby="cohorts-heading">
      <div class="section-kicker">Current cohort</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="cohorts-heading">{{ site.cohort.locationLabel }}</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">The next Fight for Manhood experience is open for registration now.</p>
      <div class="cohort-card">
        <div class="cohort-card-heading">
          <span class="eyebrow">{{ site.cohort.name }}</span>
          <h3>Come as you are. Leave ready to lead.</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="cohort-meta">
          <span>Begins {{ site.cohort.startDate | isoDate }}</span><span>{{ site.cohort.day }}</span><span>{{ site.cohort.time }}</span><span>{{ site.cohort.cost }}</span><span>Ends {{ site.cohort.endDate | isoDate }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="venue"><a href="{{ site.cohort.mapUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ site.cohort.venue }}<br>{{ site.cohort.address1 }}, {{ site.cohort.cityStateZip }}</a></p>
        <p class="muted">The cost is not money. The cost is honesty and commitment. Men procrastinate. Leaders decide.</p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button primary" href="/register/">Reserve your place</a>
          <a class="button" href="/program/">See the battle plan</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="coming-soon" aria-labelledby="coming-soon-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Fight is expanding</span>
        <h3 id="coming-soon-heading">Coming soon</h3>
        <p>Future Fight for Manhood cohorts are being developed in these communities.</p>
        <ul class="location-list">
          {% for location in site.comingSoon %}<li>{{ location }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask about a future cohort &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section class="section interview-feature" id="interview" aria-labelledby="interview-heading">
      <div class="interview-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">On the air &middot; August 25, 2026</span>
        <h2 id="interview-heading">Hear the story behind Fight for Manhood.</h2>
        <p>Brad Maynard and Dr. Jody Griffin join Hallerin Hilton Hill on The HHH Show to talk about the wounds men carry, the brotherhood they need, and the man God created them to be.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interview-player">
        <div class="interview-player-heading">
          <span>Radio interview</span>
          <strong>Fight for Manhood</strong>
          <small>17 min 51 sec</small>
        </div>
        <audio controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Fight for Manhood interview on The HHH Show">
          <source src="/assets/audio/fight-for-manhood-radio-interview-2026-08-25.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
          Your browser does not support audio playback.
        </audio>
        <div class="interview-player-footer">
          <span>Courtesy of NewsTalk 98.7 and The HHH Show</span>
          <a class="button small" href="/assets/audio/fight-for-manhood-radio-interview-2026-08-25.mp3" download>Download MP3</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="stakes-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="stakes-heading">The stakes</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>The problem</h3>
          <p>Most men are not &ldquo;bad.&rdquo; They are at war with themselves. They compromise, hide, manage appearances, and mistake shame for identity.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>The cost</h3>
          <p>A man can look solid and still be coming apart inside. What he refuses to confront will shape his home and the next generation.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>The fight</h3>
          <p>We confront wounds, drag darkness into the light, move from fear to faith, and build disciplined strength anchored in identity.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="happens-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="happens-heading">What happens here</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">This is not a lecture series. Every week moves from exposure to responsibility, relationship, healing, and action.</p>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <article class="card"><h3>Expose what's hidden</h3><p>Secrecy is where shame breeds. We bring it into the light, not to condemn you, but to restore you.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Rebuild identity</h3><p>You stop performing for approval and stand as a son. Obedience flows from relationship, not anxiety.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Forge responsibility</h3><p>No blaming. No excuses. You take ownership without domination, and you lead without disappearing.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3>Strengthen the home</h3><p>We go after anger, silence, and the damage they cause. You become dangerous to darkness, not to your family.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="voices-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="voices-heading">What other men say</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Real men. Real change. These are voices from the brotherhood.</p>
      <div class="testimonial-grid homepage-testimonials">
        {% for testimonial in communityTestimonials %}
          {% if testimonial.homepage %}
          <article class="card testimonial testimonial-quote">
            <blockquote class="testimonial-entry"><p>&ldquo;{{ testimonial.homepageQuote }}&rdquo;</p></blockquote>
            <div class="attribution"><strong>{{ testimonial.author }}</strong> &middot; {{ testimonial.title }}</div>
          </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="/stories/">Read More Stories</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section center final-invitation" aria-labelledby="apply-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">Your next step</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="apply-heading">The fight is bigger than one city.</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Join the current Knoxville cohort, ask about a future location, or start a conversation about bringing Fight for Manhood to your community.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="#cohorts">View current cohorts</a><a class="button" href="/contact/">Start a conversation</a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
